## Category: Invalid
## Feature: Static Type System (No Implicit Coercion)
## Spec Reference: docs/language-spec/type-system.md#4-local-type-inference
## Violation: Attempting to assign an `i32` value to an `i64` variable without explicit `as` cast.
## Expected Diagnostic: WON-TYP-001: Type mismatch: Expected 'i64', found 'i32'. Implicit numeric conversions are forbidden; use explicit 'as i64'.

fn main():
    let small_number: i32 = 42
    let large_number: i64 = small_number    # Reject: Implicit widening is forbidden
